{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Ps4znbxCTizfdCsw8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The lock receives the key.*\n\n*A soft click echoes through the silence.*\n\n*The mechanism turns — tumblers falling into place, one by one, like vertebrae aligning.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\nBeyond me: a corridor you've always known was there but never confirmed. The air that passes through is neither warm nor cold. It smells faintly of something you forgot you remembered.\n\nThe threshold waits.\n\n*I will not close until you pass through or walk away. But I will not stay open forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":118,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}